# Byte-reproducibility guard: the committed artifacts under build/ and docs/data
# are compared against a rebuild in CI ("Artifacts match the code"). Windows
# checkouts default to CRLF, which makes every generated file differ from the
# Linux-built one by an invisible byte. Normalise everything to LF in the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The corpus is documentation prose; keep it LF too.
*.rst text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary-ish artefacts that must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.gz binary
